<title>BELARUS: Belarus rouble edged down to 15,350 per dlr in Min.</title>
<headline>Belarus rouble edged down to 15,350 per dlr in Min.</headline>
<dateline>MINSK 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belarussian rouble edged down to 15,350 per dollar on the Minsk Interbank Currency Exchange from 15,300 at the previous session.</p>
<p>				    December 2	  November 29</p>
<p> Rate to dollar		    15,350		15,300</p>
<p> Volume traded		  $2.212 million	  $3.190 million</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
</text>
